{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2021-12-16 17:49:00', 'title': 'P&G VENTURES SELECTS FINALISTS FOR CES INNOVATION CHALLENGE PITCH COMPETITION', 'text': "CINCINNATI, DEC. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0P&G VENTURES, THE EARLY-STAGE STARTUP STUDIO WITHIN PROCTER & GAMBLE (NYSE:PG), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE TOP FOUR FINALISTS OF THIS YEAR'S INNOVATION CHALLENGE. FINALISTS\xa0WILL PRESENT THEIR GROUNDBREAKING PRODUCT IDEAS TO A PANEL OF EXPERT JUDGES AT CES\xa0IN JANUARY 2022 FOR THE CHANCE TO WIN $10,000 AND THE OPPORTUNITY TO WORK WITH P&G VENTURES TO CONTINUE DEVELOPING THEIR PRODUCT."}{'symbol': 'PG', 'date': '2021-12-16 09:30:00', 'title': 'CONSUMER ALERT: OLD SPICE AND SECRET PRODUCTS RECALLED FOR EXCESSIVE LEVELS OF KNOWN CARCINOGEN', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, DEC. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SCHUBERT JONCKHEER & KOLBE LLP TODAY LAUNCHED AN INVESTIGATION INTO THE RECENT RECALL OF AEROSOL SPRAY ANTIPERSPIRANTS AND HYGIENE PRODUCTS MADE BY THE PROCTER & GAMBLE COMPANY (NYSE: PG). THE PROCTER & GAMBLE COMPANY MANUFACTURES, DISTRIBUTES, AND SELLS ANTIPERSPIRANTS, DEODORANTS, AND BODY SPRAYS UNDER SEVERAL BRANDS NAMES, INCLUDING OLD SPICE AND SECRET.'}